==Battleground==
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sonic (Enemy)|Sonic]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields and backliners like [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Dragon Cat]] to win.

